  "notes": "CONJUGATION (godan-ru):\n- Negative: なぞらない\n- Te-form: なぞって\n- Past: なぞった\n- Passive: なぞられる\n\nTRANSITIVITY:\nTransitive.\n\nUSAGE:\nSense 1 is commonly used in handwriting practice and art. Sense 2 is used figuratively for following the same course or path as something prior.\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- ⟦{文字|もじ}→文字：03632_moji⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧なぞる: to trace characters\n- ⟦{輪郭|りんかく}→輪郭：14295_rinkaku⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧なぞる: to trace the outline\n- ⟦{足跡|あしあと}→足跡：04095_ashiato⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧なぞる: to follow in someone's footsteps\n- ⟦{歴史|れきし}→歴史：02267_rekishi⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧なぞる: to retrace history",
